  - transliteration
abstract: >-
  A CPU-only cascade for multi-source business entity resolution: script-aware normalisation,
  hashed multi-key blocking, a cross-fitted LightGBM pair model, fine-tuned MiniLM cross-encoders on
  uncertain pairs, an entity-group twin veto, EM label-shift calibration and per-entity expected-F0.5
  set selection. Public leaderboard macro F0.5 0.980385; held-out 0.98637.
